################################################################################
# SPARTA logo, idea 8: a bow shock on the lettering itself
#
# Only the lambda and the SPARTA text are surfaces - letters.surf, lifted out
# of logotext2d.surf, which also carries the r = 37 boundary circle the other
# variants use.  The domain starts empty and a Mach 6.2 stream enters at xlo, so
# the bow shocks build in front of each letter as the gas arrives rather than
# being there from the first frame, and the gaps between the letters choke.
#
# The gas is half gold and half red, which is the emblem's palette worn by the
# flow rather than by the shape.
#
# The wakes close a few body widths downstream, which is physics rather than a
# boundary artifact - both x faces are outflow.  The stream is directed at 2000
# m/s but each molecule also carries about 353 m/s of thermal speed, so a void
# of width d fills in over roughly d*U/vthermal, near 57 units for a letter ten
# across.  The diffuse wall feeds it too: at full accommodation every molecule
# that strikes a letter is re-emitted over a cosine distribution, backwards
# into the wake included.  Specular surfaces would leave the wakes far emptier.
################################################################################

dimension           2
seed                12345
global              gridcut 0.0 comm/sort yes
boundary            oo rr p

create_box          -600e-1 600e-1 -600e-1 600e-1 -0.5 0.5
create_grid         100 100 1
balance_grid        rcb cell

read_surf           letters.surf group letters
surf_collide        skin diffuse 300.0 1.0
surf_modify         all collide skin

species             logo.species N O B Nh Oh Nm Om
global              fnum 8.4e16

# half gold, half red: equal fractions of the two emblem species
mixture             flow N O nrho 1.17e18 temp 300 vstream 2000.0 0.0 0.0
mixture             flow N frac 0.5
mixture             flow O frac 0.5

# start empty and let the stream fill the domain, so the bow shocks build up
# in front of each letter rather than being there from the first frame
fix                 in emit/face flow xlo

collide             vss all logo.vss
collide_modify      vremax 100 yes

timestep            1.0e-4
stats               400
stats_style         step cpu np ncoll nscoll

dump                3 image all 40 let.*.ppm type type pdiam 0.9 &
                    surf one 0.005 box no 1 size 500 500 &
                    view 0 0 center s 0.5 0.5 0.5 zoom 1.98
dump_modify         3 pad 5 backcolor white &
                    color shieldred 0.75 0 0 color shieldgold 0.95 0.75 0.05 &
                    color ink 0.0 0.0 0.0 &
                    pcolor 1 shieldgold pcolor 2 shieldred scolor * ink

run                 2400
